    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexa Fusion 2048</strong> is an addictive and engaging puzzle game that takes the classic 2048 gameplay to the next level with a unique hexagonal twist! Your goal is to strategically shoot hexagonal number blocks onto the board, merging them with identical ones to create larger numbers and achieve the highest score possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>How to Play:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect spot to shoot the next 2048 hexagonal block.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge matching numbers to form higher values and clear space on the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strategy and precision to keep the board open for new moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a block reaches the limit position, the game ends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Boosters &amp; Power-ups:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you overcome challenging moments, each level provides <strong>3 booster hammers</strong> to break unwanted blocks and create better opportunities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its <strong>relaxing yet brain-teasing</strong> mechanics, <strong>Hexa Fusion 2048</strong> offers an exciting mix of puzzle-solving and strategic planning. How high can you score before running out of space? Test your skills and aim for the ultimate fusion! \ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udfaf</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexa Fusion 2048</strong> is an addictive and engaging puzzle game that takes the classic 2048 gameplay to the next level with a unique hexagonal twist! Your goal is to strategically shoot hexagonal number blocks onto the board, merging them with identical ones to create larger numbers and achieve the highest score possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>How to Play:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect spot to shoot the next 2048 hexagonal block.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge matching numbers to form higher values and clear space on the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strategy and precision to keep the board open for new moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a block reaches the limit position, the game ends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Boosters &amp; Power-ups:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you overcome challenging moments, each level provides <strong>3 booster hammers</strong> to break unwanted blocks and create better opportunities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its <strong>relaxing yet brain-teasing</strong> mechanics, <strong>Hexa Fusion 2048</strong> offers an exciting mix of puzzle-solving and strategic planning. How high can you score before running out of space? Test your skills and aim for the ultimate fusion! \ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udfaf</p>",
    "short_description": "Hexa Fusion 2048 is a fun and addictive hexagonal puzzle game! Shoot number blocks onto the board, merge them to create bigger numbers, and aim for the highest score. Use booster hammers to clear obstacles, but be careful\u2014if a block reaches the limit, the game ends! Can you master the fusion? \ud83d\udd25\ud83c\udfaf",
